# AGENT: Glyph tables for the kit's pixel faces. Original art (MIT, this addon).
# INVARIANT: GRAIN rows: 0-6 cap height (row 6 is the baseline row), 7-8 descenders.
# SMALL rows: 0-4 cap height, 5 descender. '#' is ink, anything else is paper. Every row
# of a glyph is the same width. TaPixelFont builds FontFiles from these.
# DO NOT: Trace another font. Add a glyph without checking it next to its neighbours.

